    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB1RD_0LC0RB_1LA1LB_1LC1LD p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB1RD_0LC0RB_1LA1LB_1LC1LD p j' E).
